  the metadata below. The released weights are not covered by this repository's
  GPL-3.0 grant; see NOTICE section 4.
title: "Neural Floorplan: Raster Floor Plans to Classified CAD Geometry"
abstract: >-
  Combines seven-class semantic segmentation with graph-based wall extraction to
  turn raster floor plans into classified, CAD-like vector geometry, prioritising
  wall topology, circulation, and opening logic over pixel-perfect tracing.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kim
    given-names: Daegeun
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-16"
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/daegeun-kim/neural_floorplan"
keywords:
  - floor plan vectorization
  - semantic segmentation
  - wall topology
  - architectural drawing
  - computer vision
